 integrations/flight-dynamics/gmat.ipynb       | 28 +++++----
 integrations/flight-dynamics/gmat.md          |  4 ++
 integrations/flight-dynamics/gmat_reader.py   | 62 +++++++++++++++++--
 4 files changed, 90 insertions(+), 16 deletions(-)

